	(text "CE tied low (clock always enabled). PL low-pulse parallel-loads all chips (HAL: ld 0 then 1).\nOptocoupler outputs are emitter followers with a 10k pull-down, so a conducting contact reads 1 (active high,\nno inversion in tester_core)."
